ia Elevation Point Query Service (https://epqs.nationalmap.gov/v1/json), sampled every ~12.5 m (DEM resolution(s) reported: 1 m); cross-checked against OpenTopoData ned10m; 62 m rolling median + 75 m centred moving average, resampled to ~25 m; grade cap 22% per step (applied to 0 steps)."}